  "title": "VALHI REPORTS THIRD QUARTER 2025 RESULTS",
  "summary": "Dallas, Texas , Nov. 06, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Valhi, Inc. (NYSE: VHI) reported a net loss attributable to Valhi stockholders of $22.2 million , or $.78 per share, in the third quarter of 2025 compared to net income of $57.5 million , or $2.01 per share, in the third quarter of 2024.",
